{"title":"2015 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 7","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Consider the operation \"minus the reciprocal of,\" defined by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/d/9/0d97aced07f7efeb77b7b85f77ea9b1333cc02ed.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a\\diamond b=a-\\frac{1}{b}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"102\" height=\"37\" />. What is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/c/1/3c1151d7db248af97ba22f812e68de042d5b0d3b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$((1\\diamond2)\\diamond3)-(1\\diamond(2\\diamond3))$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"200\" height=\"18\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/d/9ad7d98c07e13f32892142baaeff70487ff38779.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) } -\\dfrac{7}{30} \\qquad\\textbf{(B) } -\\dfrac{1}{6} \\qquad\\textbf{(C) } 0 \\qquad\\textbf{(D) } \\dfrac{1}{6} \\qquad\\textbf{(E) } \\dfrac{7}{30}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"430\" height=\"37\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/4/e/14e2d3d67f6ac174d2b6713529165cb315e31350.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1\\diamond2=1-\\dfrac{1}{2}=\\dfrac{1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"139\" height=\"37\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/6/f/f6fc92317ca281da20b68a990c4fc99172296c0e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1\\diamond2)\\diamond3=\\dfrac{1}{2}\\diamond3=\\dfrac{1}{2}-\\dfrac{1}{3}=\\dfrac{1}{6}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"247\" height=\"37\" />. Also, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/b/4bb100a9a1cf4f0f2a23d16f928a5f598f4f4c06.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2\\diamond3=2-\\dfrac{1}{3}=\\dfrac{5}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"139\" height=\"37\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/e/fce804143ba71e8af439cfd73a0fd5586eefba97.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1\\diamond(2\\diamond3)=1-\\dfrac{1}{5/3}=1-\\dfrac{3}{5}=\\dfrac{2}{5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"267\" height=\"42\" />. Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/2/c/22c1d59f7f7584db22fe0fa95e90cd58631521e0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$((1\\diamond2)\\diamond3)-(1\\diamond(2\\diamond3))=\\dfrac{1}{6}-\\dfrac{2}{5}=\\boxed{\\mathbf{(A)}\\ -\\dfrac{7}{30}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"390\" height=\"48\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_1\">Video Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/opghB-8aScI\">https://youtu.be/opghB-8aScI</a>\n</p><p>~Education, the Study of Everything\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/SkInNyZkxzA\">https://youtu.be/SkInNyZkxzA</a>\n</p><p>~savannahsolver\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10B\" title=\"2015 AMC 10B\">2015 AMC 10B</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10B_Problems\" title=\"2015 AMC 10B Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10B_Answer_Key\" title=\"2015 AMC 10B Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2015 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2015 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 8\">Problem 8</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2015 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2015 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2015 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2015 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2015 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2015 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2015 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2015 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2015 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2015 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AM